# Phase 43-03 (PRO-01): Supabase web client configuration.
# Both values are PUBLIC and safe to ship in the client bundle:
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_URL is the project's public REST/Auth endpoint.
#   - VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the "anon" public key; it has zero direct
#     table access (RLS revoked for anon on every table — see
#     supabase/migrations/0001_pro_backend.sql) and is protected by Row
#     Level Security + SECURITY DEFINER RPCs, not by secrecy.
# NEVER add a service-role key or any other secret here — this file is
# committed to git and its values ship to every browser (Pitfall 4).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Phase 43-06 (PRO-04): Paddle Billing (Merchant of Record) — client side.
# ONLY these three are public and safe to bundle (Pitfall 4):
#   - VITE_PADDLE_CLIENT_TOKEN is the client-side token (Paddle Dashboard ->
#     Developer Tools -> Authentication -> Client-side token). A test_ prefix
#     automatically selects the sandbox environment.
#   - VITE_PADDLE_PRICE_ID_* are the public price ids for the two Pro SKUs
#     (EUR 6.90/mo and EUR 69/yr — must match the ToS values exactly).
#   - VITE_PADDLE_CANCEL_URL (optional) is the public Paddle-hosted customer
#     portal/cancel link shown to subscribed users.
VITE_PADDLE_CLIENT_TOKEN=
VITE_PADDLE_PRICE_ID_MONTHLY=
VITE_PADDLE_PRICE_ID_ANNUAL=
VITE_PADDLE_CANCEL_URL=

# SERVER-ONLY billing secrets — documented here, but NEVER set them in any
# VITE_-prefixed var and NEVER fill them in a committed file. They live only
# in the Vercel project env (api/webhooks/paddle.ts reads them):
#   PADDLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET       Paddle Dashboard -> Developer Tools ->
#                               Notifications -> webhook signing secret.
#   PADDLE_API_KEY              Paddle Dashboard -> Developer Tools ->
#                               Authentication -> API key (server-side).
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings ->
#                               API -> service_role (bypasses RLS; the ONLY
#                               writer of the entitlements table).
# PADDLE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# PADDLE_API_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
